label: Assemble Adjacency
description: >-
  The A2 card block. Second fan-in, and the end of the slice.

  Its output cannot name the parcel it is about -- see DryWetAdjacency.edge.
input:
  allOf:
    - SoilSummary
    - DwellingRating
output: DryWetAdjacency
examples:
  - given:
      SoilSummary:
        dryAcres: 2.202718
        wetAcres: 4.4054
        dominantMukey: "162341"
        dominantCokey: "21012345"
        dominantSeries: "Kalkaska"
      DwellingRating:
        cokey: "21012345"
        rating: "Somewhat limited"
    expect:
      DryWetAdjacency:
        dryAcres: 2.202718
        wetAcres: 4.4054
        dominantSeries: "Kalkaska"
        dwellingRating: "Somewhat limited"
